So we set to None or string.\n\nWe need to wrap the function in a JSON object with key \"implementation\".\n\nWrite code accordingly.\n\nNow produce the final answer as JSON with one key \"implementation\" and value as a string containing the Python source code, properly escaped for JSON.\n\nWe'll write the code with triple quotes inside? Use raw string? We'll write a normal string and escape it.\n\nLet's construct."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1579,"completion_tokens":2738,"total_tokens":4317,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1536},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2355},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1536,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":43},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}